Follow agents.md, spec.md, and docs/architecture.md.
Keep Python domain logic separate from the Next.js UI.
Use strict Pydantic models, bounded inputs, explicit nullable unknowns and provenance.
Never hardcode secrets or invent sample-size inputs.
Use synthetic data and mocked provider calls in automated tests.
Implement and verify one incremental slice at a time; document unfinished milestones honestly.
